title: "Interactive Product Demo: a Claude Code skill for animated product demos without video"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Claude Code skill that builds landing-page product demos out of live DOM
  and CSS instead of a screen recording: a replica of the real UI, a scripted cursor, and
  a camera that pans and spotlights each control.
